Subject: [PATCH 320/638] cef: expose Chrome context menu hooks

Apply CEF's upstream chrome_browser_context_menus patch as a discrete prerequisite for CEF menu observation and interception.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-context-menu-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch stack is authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: build 16 reported missing context menu accelerator, source WebContents and menu-created callback APIs

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/16-libcef-static-after-blink-devtools.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; c3f8be772c
